",", allowing only integers; a positive integer sets the number of decimal places, and ",[257,282,283],{},"true"," allows any number. ",[257,286,287],{},"thousand-separator",[257,289,283],{},", showing thousands separators on blur; pass ",[257,292,279],{}," for numbers such as years or codes that should not have them.",[295,296],"component-example",{"name":297},"input-number-decimal",[299,300,301,316,329],"ul",{},[302,303,304,305,308,309,312,313,315],"li",{},"While typing, the sign, decimal point and trailing zeros are kept; incomplete input (such as just ",[257,306,307],{},"-",") binds ",[257,310,311],{},"null",". On blur, the value is rounded and padded according to ",[257,314,275],{},", and thousands separators are shown.",[302,317,318,319,321,322,324,325,328],{},"Non-numeric characters and decimals beyond the set places cannot be typed, and pasted text is reverted too. When ",[257,320,275],{}," is ",[257,323,279],{}," or ",[257,326,327],{},"0",", the decimal point cannot be typed.",[302,330,331,332,321,335,338,339,321,341,324,343,345,346,348],{},"On focus, the text switches to the editable form without separators. ",[257,333,334],{},"inputmode",[257,336,337],{},"numeric"," when ",[257,340,275],{},[257,342,279],{},[257,344,327],{},", and ",[257,347,275],{}," otherwise, so phones show the matching number keyboard.",[350,351,352,353,324,356,359,360,362,363,365,366,369,370,375,376,380],"tip",{},"The component has no ",[257,354,355],{},"min",[257,357,358],{},"max",". It is a text input underneath, so the native ",[257,361,355],{},", ",[257,364,358],{}," and ",[257,367,368],{},"step"," have no effect. Use ",[371,372,374],"a",{"href":373},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fform\u002Fvalidation","validation rules"," for ranges; see ",[371,377,379],{"href":378},"#with-form-validation","With form validation"," below.",[267,382,384],{"id":383},"unit","Unit",[254,386,387,388,321,390,392,393,396],{},"When ",[257,389,383],{},[257,391,283],{},", \"NTD\" is shown (\"元\" in Traditional Chinese, switching with the locale). The text can be changed in ",[371,394,47],{"href":395},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages#overridable-items","; passing a string shows that text. Units vary in length, so the right padding follows the unit's actual width and the number never overlaps the unit.",[295,398],{"name":399},"input-number-unit",[254,401,402,365,404,406,407,411,412,414,415,417,418,260],{},[257,403,383],{},[257,405,287],{}," can also have site-wide defaults; see ",[371,408,410],{"href":409},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults#configurable-props","Configurable props",". The site-wide ",[257,413,383],{}," only accepts ",[257,416,283],{}," \u002F ",[257,419,279],{},[267,421,423],{"id":422},"variants","Variants",[254,425,426,427,362,430,365,433,436,437,260],{},"Uses the ",[257,428,429],{},"variant",[257,431,432],{},"color",[257,434,435],{},"highlight"," of ",[257,438,439],{},"UInput",[295,441],{"name":442},"input-number-variant",[267,444,446],{"id":445},"icon","Icon",[254,448,426,449,436,451,453],{},[257,450,445],{},[257,452,439],{},", shown on the left alongside the unit.",[295,455],{"name":456},"input-number-icon",[267,458,460],{"id":459},"size-and-states","Size and states",[254,462,463,464,467],{},"While loading, the spinner sits to the right of the unit and the number and unit move left to make room. See ",[371,465,87],{"href":466},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon"," for the behavior shared by all states.",[295,469],{"name":470},"input-number-states",[262,472,474],{"id":473},"examples","Examples",[267,476,379],{"id":477},"with-form-validation",[254,479,480,481,484,485,365,488,491,492,495],{},"Use ",[257,482,483],{},"requiredNumber"," for required fields and add ranges with ",[257,486,487],{},"v.minValue",[257,489,490],{},"v.maxValue","; use ",[257,493,494],{},"optionalNonNegativeNumber"," for optional non-negative numbers. What gets validated and submitted is a number, without separators.",[295,497],{"name":498},"input-number-validation",[267,500,502],{"id":501},"centered-numbers","Centered numbers",[254,504,505,508,509,512,513,516],{},[257,506,507],{},"ui.base"," has a built-in ",[257,510,511],{},"text-right","; pass ",[257,514,515],{},"text-center"," to center the number, which suits short fields inside a sentence. With a unit or while loading, the right padding follows the trailing content's actual width, so the number never overlaps the unit.",[295,518],{"name":519},"input-number-center",[267,521,523],{"id":522},"clear-button","Clear button",[254,525,526,527,530,531,533,534,380],{},"Put a clear button in ",[257,528,529],{},"#trailing",". ",[257,532,529],{}," sits next to the unit and the loading icon without replacing them; see ",[371,535,537],{"href":536},"#slots","Slots",[295,539],{"name":540},"input-number-clearable",[267,542,544],{"id":543},"accessing-the-native-input","Accessing the native input",[254,546,547,548,551],{},"Get the native input through ",[257,549,550],{},"inputRef"," on the template ref.",[295,553],{"name":554},"input-number-expose",[262,556,558],{"id":557},"props","Props",[560,561],"component-props",{"name":562},"ShuoInputNumber",[254,564,565,566,569,570,362,573,362,576,362,579,362,582,365,585,260],{},"See ",[371,567,87],{"href":568},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#shared-props"," for the behavior of ",[257,571,572],{},"size",[257,574,575],{},"disabled",[257,577,578],{},"loading",[257,580,581],{},"skeleton",[257,583,584],{},"id",[257,586,587],{},"name",[262,589,537],{"id":590},"slots",[592,593,594,609],"table",{},[595,596,597],"thead",{},[598,599,600,604,606],"tr",{},[601,602,603],"th",{},"Slot",[601,605,558],{},[601,607,608],{},"Description",[610,611,612,637,651],"tbody",{},[598,613,614,620,625],{},[615,616,617],"td",{},[257,618,619],{},"leading",[615,621,622],{},[257,623,624],{},"ui",[615,626,627,628,362,630,365,633,636],{},"Leading content; when not passed, ",[257,629,445],{},[257,631,632],{},"leadingIcon",[257,634,635],{},"avatar"